{"id": "C8BoEiWvQPX", "title": "Video by gauravecomm", "description": "𝐀𝐧𝐨𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐫 𝐒𝐢𝐱 𝐅𝐢𝐠𝐮𝐫𝐞𝐬 𝐅𝐢𝐭𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐁𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐁𝐨𝐨𝐤𝐬: 𝟑 𝐆𝐚𝐦𝐞-𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐭 𝐆𝐫𝐨𝐰𝐭𝐡\n\nRunning ads is essential for every brand to have massive exposure in front of your customers, but if you are solely focused on that, you're likely bleeding money and miss out on real growth, especially at the scaling phase. \n\nHere are three game-changing tactics that can transform your brand and drive sustainable growth.\n\n💡 𝐑𝐞𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐘𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐖𝐢𝐧𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐂𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐬\n\nHave you noticed certain ads outperforming others? It’s not luck; it’s insight! Here’s how you can leverage it:\n\n𝐀𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐩: Identify your top-performing ads. What makes them stand out? Is it the imagery, the messaging, or the offer? Create variations of these ads to consistently engage your audience.\n\n𝐖𝐡𝐲 𝐈𝐭 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐬: You’ll talk to your customers in a way that resonates, building stronger connections and boosting engagement.\n\n🔄 Shift from Selling to Making Them Buy\n\nStop pushing products and start showcasing why your product is the best choice. Focus on what makes you unique!\n\n𝐀𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐩: Highlight product differentiators and benefits. Use compelling storytelling, testimonials, and comparisons to show why customers should choose you.\n\n𝐖𝐡𝐲 𝐈𝐭 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐬: By highlighting unique benefits, you make it easier for customers to see the value and make a purchase decision.\n\n🎁 Focus on Increasing Repeat Customers\n\nDid you know it's cheaper to keep an existing customer than to acquire a new one? Let’s capitalize on that!\n\n𝐀𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐩: Develop loyalty programs and special offers to re-engage past customers with tailored offers they can’t resist. Think about exclusive discounts, early access to new products, or special bundles.\n\n𝐖𝐡𝐲 𝐈𝐭 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐬: Happy customers come back and spend more. Plus, they’re more likely to recommend you to others!\n\nIf you've read this entire thing please toss a \"like\" or a \"❤️\" on this post so I can see who reads until the end.\n\nComment below or DM Me to learn more about implementing these strategies in your business.\n\nLove you ladies & gents.", "channel": "gauravecomm", "uploader_id": "48548887345", "uploader": "Gaurav Kapoor Ecom & Lead Gen Expert", "timestamp": 1718001552, "like_count": 1, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1015025453513996a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 43.703, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fskt4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t16/f2/m69/AQNGwF1ih7GrVP9gckYOX5iur1kcRZb0Eet7ERKxuKYBrlSC8r3LRjXKTtkU8rpP-A4JTAiZFlnTcECf51bc8wv2.mp4?strext=1&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdrFfx6SmyztWUcsVXoXLZnAjd5uYiws4WCNmcNKDP3RhAJ0sPeCMXlWjT18J1mVIOs&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fskt4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=sJMR8dEa6EgQ7kNvwH4rWRl&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Xsh8hoIs1LA0jueR0K1PLg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQJMg8A618q_3AIDPuyX1q59QwjjeFQfnMaz9FQG8B2bCQ&oe=6ABEB3F6", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 43.703, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1015025453513996a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fskt4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m82/AQM5x2akNtfT3IvhqSCwm-zJPNT7k_kpa4AX-eNxH1dueLajIh0wX56Q8sN8vPKFiWWhWg3bWmaRN7aqpDv4BtZhICMqo4h41fkTaNY.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Adr-JRT6-cgcwudv-ZhbTcLL_xTcEhVebXFAMnIwbQipJXfVOn-urw42agodsPNgmzk&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fskt4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=X2Zq40QHjKsQ7kNvwHHMhRl&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9